<title>HUNGARY: TVK Q1 '97 net income HUF 2.748 bln.</title>
<headline>TVK Q1 '97 net income HUF 2.748 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				Jan-March 1997    Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Operating income	   3,274     vs    1,716</p>
<p>Profit before tax</p>
<p>	and extraordinaries    3,322     vs    2,030</p>
<p>Profit before</p>
<p>	extraordinaries	  2,748     vs    1,717</p>
<p>    Net income		   2,748     vs    1,717</p>
<p>    Sales revenue	     19,728     vs   14,195</p>
<p>    Costs of sales	    14,398     vs   10,477</p>
<p>    Gross profit		 5,330     vs    3,718</p>
<p>    Gen., admin costs	  2,056     vs    2,002</p>
<p>    Other revenues		 886     vs	810</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	   811     vs	866</p>
<p>    Interest revenue	     177     vs	491</p>
<p>    Interest expenditures	204     vs	121</p>
<p>    Taxation			 574     vs	313</p>
<p>NOTE: TVK is a chemicals company. The figures are not audited, they are not consolidated and they were calculated in accordance with International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
